dsh-Go · InstaBox Edition

This repository is an unofficial fork of dsh-Go (https://github.com/ccch1mneyyy/dsh-go),
and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the upstream project.

License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. The upstream LICENSE file is kept
unchanged; upstream copyright and every third-party notice in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
remain in effect.

Changes in this fork (保持与原仓库相同的 AGPL-3.0 许可):
- InstaBox remote-host support: wake before SSH, activity leases and a small work
  command while a link is open (InstaBox pauses idle machines on the host side).
- Session transcript cache with synchronous replay, so a cached conversation paints
  immediately instead of waiting for the Host to resend a window.
- SSH link hardening: single-flight connect, reopen stagger, unary concurrency gate,
  keepalive convergence, WebSocket close-code logging.
- Fork defaults: anonymous usage reporting removed, no forced update sheet.

Upstream remains the body of this project; this fork only adapts it to InstaBox and
keeps the changes above.